  "body": "[vco.m~] is a MERDA voltage controlled oscillator module with a polyphonic MIDI pitch input (60 when nothing is connected) and CV inputs for frequency modulation, phase modulation and pulse width modulation (for the square and variable saw shapes), plus a sync input that takes impulses. A detune number box shifts the pitch in Hz, and a transposition knob by up to 3 octaves."
